# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install `qiskit-ibm-runtime` {#install-qiskit-ibm-runtime}"
msgstr "Instalace `qiskit-ibm-runtime` {#install-qiskit-ibm-runtime}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to install `qiskit-ibm-runtime`:\n"
msgstr "Pro instalaci `qiskit-ibm-runtime` postupuj podle těchto kroků:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` repository.\n"
msgstr "Naklonuj repozitář `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change to the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` directory.\n"
msgstr "Přejdi do adresáře `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install `qiskit-runtime`. We recommend using a [virtual environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr "Nainstaluj `qiskit-runtime`. Doporučujeme použít [virtuální prostředí](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html), abys neznečistil(a) svou globální instalaci Pythonu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Standard install**:\n"
msgstr "**Standardní instalace**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Editable mode**: In this mode, you don't need to reinstall Qiskit when there are code changes to the project.\n"
msgstr "**Editovatelný režim**: V tomto režimu nemusíš Qiskit znovu instalovat, když se změní kód projektu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    In editable mode, the compiled extensions are built in _debug mode_ without optimizations.\n"
msgstr "    V editovatelném režimu se zkompilovaná rozšíření sestavují v _ladicím režimu_ bez optimalizací.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "(Optional) If you want to run tests or linting checks, install the developer requirements. We recommend using a [virtual environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr "(Volitelné) Pokud chceš spouštět testy nebo kontroly lintingu, nainstaluj požadavky pro vývojáře. Doporučujeme použít [virtuální prostředí](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html), abys neznečistil(a) svou globální instalaci Pythonu.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Další kroky {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Read the [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) to contribute to `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Doporučení\">\n"
"  - Přečti si [pokyny pro přispěvatele](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md), pokud chceš přispět do `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Nainstaluj Qiskit SDK ze zdrojového kódu](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Spusť svůj první program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Vyzkoušej výukový program, například [Groverův algoritmus](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
